msgid "The profile that is playing stays. Choose another one first."
msgstr "Το προφίλ που παίζει παραμένει. Διάλεξε πρώτα άλλο."

#. Shown at the end of release notes that were cut short; homebrew.page is a site's name and stays as it is.
#: pe/ui/update.cpp
msgid "The rest is on the app's page on homebrew.page."
msgstr "Τα υπόλοιπα βρίσκονται στη σελίδα της εφαρμογής στο homebrew.page."

#: pe/ui/update.cpp
msgid "The update could not finish"
msgstr "Η ενημέρωση δεν ολοκληρώθηκε"

